# TypeScript API project guidance

Read the project specification, design and tasks before material implementation.
Use the managed Node/pnpm profile and `gptclawctl` lifecycle/quality commands;
keep services private. The starter contains deliberate synthetic examples: adapt
routes, schemas, OpenAPI and tests to the product specification before acceptance.
Do not introduce credentials, dotenv files, dependency hooks or persistent data
without explicit approved scope. Preserve source and unrelated work.
